Here is a complete, fully working Quiz Application built using Streamlit. It includes user authentication (Registration/Login), student quiz-taking functionality with a timer and navigation, automatic scoring, performance analytics, a restart option, and an Admin Panel to manage (add, update, delete) questions.

📂 Project Structure
To run this project smoothly, create a folder named quiz_app and place the following files inside it:

app.py (Main application code)

database.json (Local JSON file to store users and questions)

requirements.txt (Dependencies)

