### 💡 Kya badla gaya hai is code mein?
1. **Fresh Reloading (`load_data()` & `save_data()`):** Ab login aur registration dono functions directly file se latest data read karte hain taaki browser cache ya old session state ki wajah se "invalid username" ki problem na aaye.
2. **Robust Initialization:** Agar `database.json` file missing ya blank hoti hai, toh yeh script automatically default admin aur sample questions ke sath file ko rebuild kar degi.
3. **Safe Option Indexing:** Agar questions update ya delete hote hain, toh radio buttons crash nahi honge (`ValueError` handling add kar di gayi hai).

Is code ko copy karke apni GitHub repository wali `app.py` mein paste kar dein aur save kardein. Aapka app automatically update ho jayega aur login flawlessly kaam karega!
